      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Wish Fish Quests</h1>\n<p>Roll d4</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Roll</th>\n<th>Quest</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Steal him the plume from Sir Finnian’s helmet.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Compose and perform a beautiful poem about his magnificence.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Fetch him some gems to line the bottom of his pool.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Pass along an insult to an Pippin Cobbleton.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
